The values of $a$ form an arithmetic sequence: $5, 10, 15, 20, \ldots, 115$, with common difference 5 and 23 terms.

## Computing the Sum

$$\text{Sum} = 5 + 10 + 15 + \cdots + 115 = 5(1 + 2 + 3 + \cdots + 23) = 5 \cdot \frac{23 \cdot 24}{2} = 5 \cdot 276 = \boxed{1380}$$

